></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate a possible serial killer.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to understand why no one seems willing to tell you what is going on...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the office at night. <strong>It\u2019s empty...</strong></p></li></ul>","developers":["Po\u00e9tica Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3326360/76f0543d04888a5cbbbd95b97b1831241c0c5dc1/header.jpg?t=1759185643","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requirements are TBA</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system.<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Requirements are TBA</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3326360/2055801873/0466bfd6d63d6de3ed9bd7e77e3199611dea6354/1758797379/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759089742","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3326360/2055801873/0466bfd6d63d6de3ed9bd7e77e3199611dea6354/1758797379/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759089742","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3326360/2055801873/0466bfd6d63d6de3ed9bd7e77e3199611dea6354/1758797379/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759089742","id":257187413,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187413/movie480.mp4?t=1759089742","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187413/movie_max.mp4?t=1759089742"},"name":"NO MORE WORK FOR ITO | Teaser","thumbnail":"htt